    "the same count cycled three times round the map and lit at one ring a step, masked to the set's neighbourhood by the inverted distance estimate at power 25: the jewels",
    "glow_filaments' falloff glow on de, painted near-black and multiplied: the dark hair outlining each jewel",
    "the tone pass, at the reference's median and p10"
